ied as a true copy by an independent and authorized certifier.","notes":null},{"title":"Carl Astor - Criminal Record","tag":"Criminal Record","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-06","description":"Please provide a certified copy of the criminal record for Cyprus.","notes":null},{"title":"Carl Astor - Bank Reference Letter","tag":"Reference Letter","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-03-02","description":"Please provide a certified copy of a bank reference letter. The letter must be on bank letterhead, must have been issued within the last six months, and must be certified as a true copy.","notes":null},{"title":"Carl Astor - Source of Wealth","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-06","description":"Please provide a certified copy of the bank statement submitted as source of wealth. Also, please provide an explanation as to why the address on the bank statement does not match the address on the Personal History Disclosure Form.","notes":null},{"title":"Ex Solution LLC - Director(s)","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-06","description":"Please note that the director(s) of Ex Solution LLC must be added in the portal and the Personal History Disclosure Form and all enclosures (with the exception of source of wealth) must be uploaded.","notes":null},{"title":"C-Suite Level Positions","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-06","description":"Please note that all those holding c-suite level positions (CEO, CFO, CTO, etc.) must be added in the portal and the Personal History Disclosure Form and all enclosures (with the exception of source of wealth) must be uploaded.","notes":null},{"title":"Jonathan Heymans - Passport","tag":"Passport","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-03-02","description":"Please upload a certified copy of the passport in the base application QPA/2024/02337.","notes":null},{"title":"Financial Statements","tag":"Financial Audit","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-24",